    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in <strong>Idle Colors</strong>, a strategic idle game where every shade of progress matters! Manage <strong>seven distinct currencies</strong>, each with its own upgradable generators, and unlock the supreme <strong>meta-currency</strong> to purchase game-changing global upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Seven Unique Currencies</strong> \u2013 Seven unique currencies, each with dedicated, upgradeable generators and one ultimate super currency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699 <strong>100 Generators per Color</strong> \u2013 Expand your production with up to 100 generators for each currency, each boosting your income exponentially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Prestige System</strong> \u2013 Reset your progress in three different<strong> </strong>ways to gain permanent boosts and reach new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Evolution Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Unlock higher generator levels and break through previous limits by evolving your production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Tier System</strong> \u2013 Progress through tiers to gain massive production boosts and unlock new gameplay layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Currency Converter</strong> \u2013 Exchange one color\u2019s currency for another to optimize your strategy and balance production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Content Progression\u00a0</strong>\u2013 New mechanics and content reveal themselves as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Automation\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Free yourself from routine tasks, automate basic purchases and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Global Goals</strong> \u2013 Complete ultimate objectives to conquer the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Leaderboards &amp; Stats</strong> \u2013 Compete with other players, track your efficiency, and analyze detailed statistics to perfect your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Vibrant Visuals</strong> \u2013 A clean, colorful UI that makes managing your empire a pleasure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Strategy, Infinite Fun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a hardcore idler or a casual player, <strong>Idle Colors</strong> offers a perfect mix of depth, progression, and satisfying optimization. How far can you push your empire? <strong>Start your idle journey now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now on Steam!</strong> \ud83c\udfae\u2728</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in <strong>Idle Colors</strong>, a strategic idle game where every shade of progress matters! Manage <strong>seven distinct currencies</strong>, each with its own upgradable generators, and unlock the supreme <strong>meta-currency</strong> to purchase game-changing global upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Seven Unique Currencies</strong> \u2013 Seven unique currencies, each with dedicated, upgradeable generators and one ultimate super currency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699 <strong>100 Generators per Color</strong> \u2013 Expand your production with up to 100 generators for each currency, each boosting your income exponentially.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>Prestige System</strong> \u2013 Reset your progress in three different<strong> </strong>ways to gain permanent boosts and reach new heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Evolution Mechanic</strong> \u2013 Unlock higher generator levels and break through previous limits by evolving your production lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Tier System</strong> \u2013 Progress through tiers to gain massive production boosts and unlock new gameplay layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Currency Converter</strong> \u2013 Exchange one color\u2019s currency for another to optimize your strategy and balance production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Content Progression\u00a0</strong>\u2013 New mechanics and content reveal themselves as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f <strong>Automation\u00a0</strong>\u2014 Free yourself from routine tasks, automate basic purchases and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Global Goals</strong> \u2013 Complete ultimate objectives to conquer the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Leaderboards &amp; Stats</strong> \u2013 Compete with other players, track your efficiency, and analyze detailed statistics to perfect your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Vibrant Visuals</strong> \u2013 A clean, colorful UI that makes managing your empire a pleasure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Strategy, Infinite Fun!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a hardcore idler or a casual player, <strong>Idle Colors</strong> offers a perfect mix of depth, progression, and satisfying optimization. How far can you push your empire? <strong>Start your idle journey now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now on Steam!</strong> \ud83c\udfae\u2728</p>",
